# Normalise line endings to LF inside the repository.
#
# This matters beyond tidiness: CI regenerates web/src/data on Linux and fails the
# build if the result differs from what was committed. Without normalisation, a file
# committed from Windows with CRLF would differ from the LF the generator writes on
# the runner, and that check would fail for no real reason.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never touch.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.pkl binary
*.pt binary
